1b4f250fa0cbefba2","layer":"original","quote":"伊夷模无子，淫灌奴部〖39〗，生子名位宫；伊夷模死，立以为王，今句丽王宫是也。其曾祖名宫，生能开目视，其国人恶之；及长大，果凶虐，数寇抄，国见残破。今王生堕地，亦能开目视人。句丽呼相似为“位”，似其祖，故名之为“位宫”。","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-909ca0dfe79690916c1a","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4a01b4f250fa0cbefba2","layer":"original","quote":"伊夷模死，立以为王，今句丽王宫是也","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
